From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 14:58:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] loader: process_attach xtajit64 dependency tree before
 arm64ec_process_init
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

arm64ec_process_init invokes FEX's BTCpu64 ProcessInit, which calls
InitCRTProcess to run xtajit64's C++ static constructors. Those ctors
use ucrtbase functions like _lock(N) — but at that point ucrtbase's
DllMain has not been called, so its lock_table[17] (master init lock)
remains zero. _lock(17) then recurses into itself indefinitely
(infinite recursion is cbnz-checked on lock_table[17].first_word being
non-zero, which DllMain is responsible for setting).

Fix: in load_arm64ec_module, walk_node_dependencies(process_attach)
on xtajit64's DdagNode before calling arm64ec_process_init. This runs
DllMains in dependency order — ucrtbase, kernel32, kernelbase get
their PROCESS_ATTACH callbacks first, so the CRT is initialized
before FEX's ctors run.

(cherry picked from commit 97a9308744063103f51a8889aa268623c06e50d2)
Madeira-commit: 06143656ec77c287eea534aaab75eb56b05c6a2c
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 dlls/ntdll/loader.c | 20 ++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index b3115fd7bdb..4dba3d010f9 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -4328,12 +4328,28 @@ static void load_arm64ec_module(void)
         NtClose( key );
     }
 
-    if ((status = load_dll( NULL, module, 0, &wm, FALSE )) ||
-        (status = arm64ec_process_init( wm->ldr.DllBase )))
+    if ((status = load_dll( NULL, module, 0, &wm, FALSE )))
     {
         ERR( "could not load %s, status %lx\n", debugstr_w(module), status );
         NtTerminateProcess( GetCurrentProcess(), status );
     }
+
+    /* Run process_attach (DllMain) on xtajit64's dependency tree BEFORE calling
+     * arm64ec_process_init. arm64ec_process_init invokes FEX's ProcessInit,
+     * which runs C++ static constructors via InitCRTProcess. Those ctors call
+     * into ucrtbase (e.g. _lock); without ucrtbase's DllMain having run, its
+     * lock_table[17] is uninitialized and _lock(17) recurses infinitely. */
+    if ((status = walk_node_dependencies( wm->ldr.DdagNode, NULL, process_attach )))
+    {
+        ERR( "process_attach for %s deps failed, status %lx\n", debugstr_w(module), status );
+        NtTerminateProcess( GetCurrentProcess(), status );
+    }
+
+    if ((status = arm64ec_process_init( wm->ldr.DllBase )))
+    {
+        ERR( "arm64ec_process_init for %s failed, status %lx\n", debugstr_w(module), status );
+        NtTerminateProcess( GetCurrentProcess(), status );
+    }
 }
 
 #endif
